# Pixel Store (Next.js 16 Storefront & Demo Admin Prototype)
# No external API keys, cloud credentials, or third-party secrets are required to run this prototype locally.
# Optional future production environment variables can be added in .env.local (which is git-ignored).
## Authentication: set real values only in ignored .env / Vercel settings.
## Generate BETTER_AUTH_SECRET privately (minimum 32 random bytes); never commit it.
BETTER_AUTH_SECRET=
BETTER_AUTH_URL=http://localhost:3000
## Comma-separated, lowercase administrator emails. Public signup remains disabled.
ADMIN_EMAILS=

## The Neon-backed storefront is the default. Set `mock` only for an explicit local UI demo.
# PIXEL_STORE_DATA_MODE=mock
